#tutor22
Major General Tyron Spirex
Caliban Strategic Centre
Secret Base 51

The KATZARIN Anachists have just invaded Littlestonia and
directly menace our territory. Even with several months
preperation for a inescapable Katzar offensive, the
Littlestonian lines were blown to bits outnumbered by the
adversary.


The President Claris Jackson designated you to head our
troops against the Katzar invadors, but it's from me that
you will receive orders.
I have vaguely heard about you and I hope that Claris hasn't
made a mistake in appointing you.
We will know very quickly if you deserve such confidence.

Your first mission will be to take two bases back from the
Katzars respectively situated to the North-East and
South-West.

The Littlestonian resistance holds a South-Eastern base,
their support will be primordial.

That is all, good luck.

You must destroy this message immediately.